Remove kerberos dependency and adjust build tooling

Removes kerberos as a dependency (cannot compile on Brazil fleet) and adds
npm overrides for security and compatibility fixes (serialize-javascript,
node-gyp-build). Also updates the gulp command to allow NODE_OPTIONS
override for memory allocation.

